{"name":"Hill's Edge","status":"ok","title":"Hill's Edge","pageId":14396,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Hill's Edge</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Forgotten City of Sunset Vale</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Western_Heartlands\" title=\"Western Heartlands\">Western Heartlands</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6,000 (winter) - 10,000 (summer)<sup id=\"cite_ref-VoloSC-p189_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VoloSC-p189-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons and armor</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Trader's Council</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Hill%27s_Edge\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Hill's Edge\">Inhabitants of  Hill's Edge</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Hill%27s_Edge\" title=\"Category:Locations in Hill's Edge\">Locations in  Hill's Edge</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Hill's Edge</b> was a small city on the <a href=\"/wiki/Dusk_Road\" title=\"Dusk Road\">Dusk Road</a>, south of <a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch\" title=\"Anauroch\">Anauroch</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Reaching\" title=\"River Reaching\">River Reaching</a>, south-east of <a href=\"/wiki/Skull_Gorge\" title=\"Skull Gorge\">Skull Gorge</a>, east of <a href=\"/wiki/Hardbuckler\" title=\"Hardbuckler\">Hardbuckler</a> and west of the <a href=\"/wiki/Sunset_Mountains\" title=\"Sunset Mountains\">Sunset Mountains</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VoloSC-p189_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VoloSC-p189-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Official_Buildings\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Official Buildings</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Religious_Buildings\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Religious Buildings</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Clubs,_Inns,_and_Taverns\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Clubs, Inns, and Taverns</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Shops\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Shops</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hill%27s_Edge?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Official_Buildings\">Official Buildings</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Official Buildings\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hill%27s_Edge?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Official Buildings\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The <span class=\"new\" title=\"Mayor's Tower (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTWF5b3IlMjdzX1Rvd2VyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Mayor's Tower</span> was a small fortress for the mayor and their bodyguards.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Religious_Buildings\">Religious Buildings</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Religious Buildings\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hill%27s_Edge?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Religious Buildings\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cry_of_Joy\" title=\"Cry of Joy\">Cry of Joy</a>, a temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Lliira\" title=\"Lliira\">Lliira</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fist_of_the_Future\" title=\"Fist of the Future\">Fist of the Future</a>, a temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Cyric\" title=\"Cyric\">Cyric</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Clubs.2C_Inns.2C_and_Taverns\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clubs,_Inns,_and_Taverns\">Clubs, Inns, and Taverns</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Clubs, Inns, and Taverns\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hill%27s_Edge?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Clubs, Inns, and Taverns\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Tarnished_Trumpet\" title=\"The Tarnished Trumpet\">The Tarnished Trumpet</a>, the best drinking spot in town.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Scarlet Stag (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2NhcmxldF9TdGFnP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Scarlet Stag</span>, a drinking hall.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"new\" title=\"Banshee at Bay (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmFuc2hlZV9hdF9CYXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Banshee at Bay</span>, a tavern known for its baked <a href=\"/wiki/Stirge\" title=\"Stirge\">stirge</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Toast\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Toast\">toast</a>, a favorite dish of <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster\" title=\"Elminster\">Elminster</a>'s.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Dr185-p59_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Dr185-p59-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Dancing Bear (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGFuY2luZ19CZWFyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Dancing Bear</span>, a drinking hall.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Worried_Wyvern_(Hill%27s_Edge)\" title=\"Worried Wyvern (Hill's Edge)\">The Worried Wyvern</a>, an inn.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Storm Griffin (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3Rvcm1fR3JpZmZpbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Storm Griffin</span>, an inn downtown.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Stone Saddle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3RvbmVfU2FkZGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Stone Saddle</span>, an cheap inn.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Six Soft Furs (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2l4X1NvZnRfRnVycz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Six Soft Furs</span>, a house of pleasure.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Shops\">Shops</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Shops\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hill%27s_Edge?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Shops\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"A Handful of Eyes (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQV9IYW5kZnVsX29mX0V5ZXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">A Handful of Eyes</span>, sells monsters and monster parts.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Lionstar Services (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGlvbnN0YXJfU2VydmljZXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Lionstar Services</span>, packs shipments for secure travel across all of <a href=\"/wiki/Toril\" title=\"Toril\">Toril</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"The Knight in the Morn (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0tuaWdodF9pbl90aGVfTW9ybj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">The Knight in the Morn</span>, sells suits of armor.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Belkin's Blades (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmVsa2luJTI3c19CbGFkZXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Belkin's Blades</span>, sells weapons.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Bent Bows (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmVudF9Cb3dzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Bent Bows</span>, sells archery supplies.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VoloSC-p189_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VoloSC-p189-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-b